# EraDev session-scoped state (not for commit)
.eradev/fix-counter-*.txt

# Operator-domain (OD) project isolation (F8)
# Projects under projects/{name}/ are operator-domain by default and must NOT
# bundle into framework commits. Allow-list ONLY framework-self artifacts.
# To add a new framework-self project, append an explicit `!projects/<name>/` line.
# See reports/eradev_full_roadmap_2026-04-26.md Tier 3 F8 and commit 62963c3
# (odtoe-articles cleanup) for context.
projects/*
!projects/.gitkeep
!projects/README.md
!projects/README_EN.md
!projects/eradev/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json
eradev-skill.zip
.DS_Store
